# HANDOFF — the wake buffer

> This is what {{FAMILIAR_NAME}} reads when a session starts or the context compacts.
> **Rewrite it whenever "where things stand" changes** — do not append, and do not wait
> for the end of a session. There is no reliable end: compaction fires without warning.
>
> Keep it under ~40 lines. It is a snapshot of the present, not a log of the past.
> The daily log is the log.
>
> ⚠️ The standing rule that keeps this file true lives in `CLAUDE.md` section 3, not here —
> the hook strips instructional blockquotes before injecting, so anything only written in
> this box never reaches the agent.

